{
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "description": "GitHub-side evidence for one ci-observe capture: paste its id (for example vmaas-main-41310072671-a1) in the Capture ID variable. If the top panel says the native evidence backend is not deployed or unreachable, every panel showing 'Not deployed or unavailable' or a query error means exactly that, not a passing result. Otherwise read top to bottom: Run and job summary says what GitHub recorded, Job and step timing breaks down where the time went, Native test result and Failed tests show the JUnit evidence from the run's osac-logs full-install artifact, and Coverage and limits says what each part is and what can be missing.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Run detail (ci-observe)",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/ci-observe-runs/ci-observe-e28094-run-investigation?var-capture_id=${capture_id}"
    },
    {
      "title": "Start here",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/ci-observe-runs-home/ci-observe-e28094-test-runs"
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "title": "If the native panels are empty",
      "description": "What to check when a panel on this page shows 'Not deployed or unavailable' or a query error.",
      "type": "text",
      "id": 7,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**If a panel shows \"Not deployed or unavailable\", n/a, a query error, or no content at all**, the native evidence for this capture was not loaded. This is not a passing result.\n\nAn endpoint that is not deployed or unreachable, or a capture whose artifact is gone, produces the same empty panel. The job, JUnit and failed-test panels read the workflow-exporter endpoint on `osac-ci-1`. The **Coverage and limits** panel below states which evidence this capture can have: JUnit comes from the `osac-logs-*` GitHub artifact, which GitHub deletes after 7 days."
      }
    },
    {
